{"id":"wb-4-171","name":"玉海楼","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"玉海楼","text":"玉海楼位于浙江省瑞安市玉海街道道院前街5号，是浙江四大藏书楼之一。由晚清著名汉学家孙诒让与其父孙衣言建于光绪十四年（1888年），并以南宋学者王应麟的著作《玉海》命名。为浙南传统建筑风格，集藏书楼、民居、私家园林为一体。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%8E%89%E6%B5%B7%E6%A5%BC","revisionId":94145924,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94145924","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/746000c25c9a06cdd0702097.jpg","title":"瑞安玉海楼（孙诒让故居）,_2021-05-02_18.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%91%9E%E5%AE%89%E7%8E%89%E6%B5%B7%E6%A5%BC%EF%BC%88%E5%AD%99%E8%AF%92%E8%AE%A9%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85%EF%BC%89,_2021-05-02_18.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ad/%E7%91%9E%E5%AE%89%E7%8E%89%E6%B5%B7%E6%A5%BC%EF%BC%88%E5%AD%99%E8%AF%92%E8%AE%A9%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85%EF%BC%89%2C_2021-05-02_18.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​瑞安玉海楼（孙诒让故居）","width":320,"height":214}}